#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Live channels, the guide and your recordings from a Channels DVR server."
msgstr "Live-Sender, TV-Programm und deine Aufnahmen von einem Channels-DVR-Server."

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Recordings on Channels DVR"
msgstr "Aufnahmen auf Channels DVR"

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Server address"
msgstr "Serveradresse"

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Like http://192.168.0.10:8089"
msgstr "Zum Beispiel http://192.168.0.10:8089"

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Only favourite channels"
msgstr "Nur Favoritensender"

#. a setting that takes a number, and its help, which says which recordings are kept.
#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Recordings to show"
msgstr "Angezeigte Aufnahmen"

#. a setting that takes a number, and its help, which says which recordings are kept.
#: src/lib.rs
msgid "The newest ones."
msgstr "Die neuesten."

#. names the setting inside "Add the {label} in the plugin's settings."
#: src/lib.rs
msgid "server address"
msgstr "Serveradresse"

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "No Channels DVR answered at {address}. Check the server and its address, then try again."
msgstr "Unter {address} hat kein Channels DVR geantwortet. Prüfe den Server und seine Adresse und versuche es dann erneut."

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Channels DVR has no channels to show. Add a source in its settings, or turn off the favourites filter."
msgstr "Channels DVR hat keine Sender zum Anzeigen. Füge in dessen Einstellungen eine Quelle hinzu oder schalte „Nur Favoritensender“ aus."
